== <script> ==
0000    1 OP_CLOSURE          1 <fn describe>
0002    | OP_DEFINE_GLOBAL    0 'describe'
0004    3 OP_GET_GLOBAL       2 'describe'
0006    | OP_CONSTANT         3 '42.000000'
0008    | OP_CALL             1
0010    | OP_PRINT
0011    4 OP_NIL
0012    | OP_RETURN
== describe ==
0000    1 OP_CONSTANT         0 'value: '
0002    | OP_GET_GLOBAL       1 '@f64.Display.toString'
0004    | OP_GET_LOCAL        1
0006    | OP_CALL             1
0008    | OP_ADD
0009    | OP_RETURN
